Description: Tools for analyzing Systems Factorial Technology data, including capacity coefficients, survivor interaction contrasts, statistical tests, assessment functions, Bayesian distribution-free SIC tests, and LBA/OU simulation utilities. Houpt, Blaha, McIntire, Havig, and Townsend (2013) <doi:10.3758/s13428-013-0377-3> provide a basic introduction to Systems Factorial Technology along with examples using the sft R package.
